WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.002
Grades K–2. Mateo, grade 1, and his teacher Mr. Yazzie. Read aloud, answered by voice and drawing, reviewed on a rubric for six-year-olds.

2
00:00:03.002 --> 00:00:07.756
Kindergarten to grade 2: One step at a time, read aloud, and answered by speaking and drawing.

3
00:00:07.756 --> 00:00:15.312
Mateo · grade 1: Mateo, grade 1, retells a story. Big type, one step a screen, and Read to me on every instruction.

4
00:00:15.312 --> 00:00:26.100
Mateo · grade 1: He records what happened first, then plays it back. No typing or reading needed.

5
00:00:26.100 --> 00:00:26.664
Mateo · grade 1: He records what happened first, then plays it back. No typing or reading needed.

6
00:00:26.664 --> 00:00:44.700
Mateo · grade 1: Then he draws how the story ended, and hands it in.

7
00:00:44.700 --> 00:00:52.816
Mr. Yazzie · grade 1 teacher: His teacher, Mr. Yazzie, gets recordings and drawings as ordinary submitted work.

8
00:00:52.816 --> 00:01:05.000
Mr. Yazzie · grade 1 teacher: A rubric written for six-year-olds: Not yet, Getting there, Got it! The grade is official only when he approves it.

9
